WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.336
-The President's ongoing
break from reality

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.071
continued this morning
on Twitter,

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.206
as we learned more
about his insistence

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:09.175
that Hurricane Dorian
was gonna hit Alabama.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.744
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:13.679
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:16.316
♪♪

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:19.052
Well, it's another Monday
in the Trump era,

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.554
which means we all awoke
to another fever dream

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.823
of cruelty, stupidity,
and corruption.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.559
Just in the last few days,
the President launched

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:29.329
a deranged attack on John Legend
and Chrissy Teigen,

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.898
a House panel is investigating
the military's use

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:33.633
of Trump-owned property
in Scotland,

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:36.202
the President
ignited bipartisan fury

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.771
when he announced
that he invited the Taliban

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:40.774
to Camp David

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:43.476
just days before
the anniversary of 9/11

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.212
while simultaneously
canceling that meeting

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.181
and upending months
of delicate peace talks.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:51.617
And he attacked former South
Carolina governor Mark Sanford,

00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:53.585
who announced
a primary challenge against him

00:00:53.585 --> 00:00:56.455
by trying to remind people
that Sanford had an affair

00:00:56.455 --> 00:00:57.957
with a woman in Argentina,

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.893
tweeting that Sanford
was found in Argentina

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:03.997
with his
"Flaming Dancer friend."

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:09.035
Now, we think he meant
to type "flamingo" dancer,

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:14.039
which also would have been wrong
because it's "Flamenco" dancer,

00:01:14.039 --> 00:01:17.243
which also would have been wrong
because there is no evidence

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:21.547
Sanford's former mistress
had ever been a flamenco dancer.

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:25.785
It's like a seven-layer dip
of presidential insanity.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.854
It's stupid stacked
on top of stupid

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:30.990
stacked on top of stupid
and then I guess guacamole.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.692
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:35.327
Also, I'd like to remind
everyone -- everyone --

00:01:35.327 --> 00:01:36.962
this is not the first time

00:01:36.962 --> 00:01:39.399
Trump has gotten details
of this story wrong.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:41.067
To explain his disappearance

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.302
when he was having the affair
back in 2009,

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:44.570
Sanford famously claimed

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.939
he had been hiking
the Appalachian Trail.

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:48.975
Trump has tried
to mock him for that before,

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:50.943
but he's gotten that detail
wrong, as well,

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:52.678
and he did it again today.

00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:55.548
-Mr. Tallahassee Trail.
Or Appalachian Trail.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.684
He's the Appalachian Trail,
right?

00:01:57.684 --> 00:01:59.518
The Tallahassee Trail
is nice, too,

00:01:59.518 --> 00:02:01.854
but I think he was
the Appalachian Trail.

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:04.190
Never liked him too much.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:07.293
I wasn't a big fan.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.762
The Tallahassee Trail.
Must be a beautiful place.

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.997
Unfortunately,
he didn't go there.

00:02:11.997 --> 00:02:15.400
He was supposed to be
vacationing

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.003
on the Tallahassee Trail,

00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:21.007
but he was actually
in Argentina.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.408
I don't know.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:25.745
Jim, do they have a
Tallahassee Trail in Argentina?

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:28.648
-No, they don't. They --

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.216
They don't have one
in Tallahassee.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:32.118
It doesn't exist.

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:34.187
The Tallahassee Trail
sounds like the name

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.189
of a chain restaurant
where they let you throw

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:38.824
peanut shells on the floor.

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:42.028
And, by the way, almost
everything I just told you about

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:43.830
happened before 8:00 a.m.
this morning.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.166
It's hard enough to process all
this insanity in an entire day,

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:50.102
but it's worse when you haven't
even had your coffee yet.

00:02:50.102 --> 00:02:51.937
I never thought I'd say this
to a president,

00:02:51.937 --> 00:02:54.507
but, please, sleep in.

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:57.177
We need to take one of those
dumb novelty T-shirts that says

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.077
"Don't talk to me
until I've had my coffee"

00:02:59.077 --> 00:03:01.614
and pass it into law.

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:03.249
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:04.884
And while all...

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:06.786
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:10.623
While all of this was happening,
Trump was also continuing

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:13.125
his use of the presidency
to enrich himself.

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:15.061
Last week,
Trump reportedly encouraged

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.363
Vice President Mike Pence
to stay at his golf resort

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.499
in Ireland, and, on Friday,
it was reported

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:22.101
that an Air Force crew made a
stop at Trump's Scottish resort.

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:25.071
Democrats are investigating
whether these obviously corrupt

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:27.140
practices violate
the Constitution,

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.842
so Trump lashed out again
this morning on Twitter,

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.978
distancing himself
from both incidents.

00:03:31.978 --> 00:03:33.513
-"I had nothing to do
with the decision

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.347
of our great vice president,
Mike Pence, to stay overnight

00:03:35.347 --> 00:03:38.384
at one of the Trump-owned
resorts in Doonbeg, Ireland."

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:41.020
-"I know nothing
about an Air Force plane

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.389
landing in an airport,
which I don't own

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:46.091
and have nothing to do with it,
near Turnberry Resort,

00:03:46.091 --> 00:03:49.595
which I do own, in Scotland,
and filling up with fuel,

00:03:49.595 --> 00:03:51.930
with the crew staying overnight
at Turnberry.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:55.467
They have good taste.
NOTHING TO DO WITH ME."

00:03:55.467 --> 00:03:59.472
-Wow. He is tap dancing faster
than a flaming dancer.

00:03:59.472 --> 00:04:04.043
Also, you can't
just tweet in all caps

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:05.678
"NOTHING TO DO WITH ME"

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:07.813
right after you admit
they stayed at your hotel

00:04:07.813 --> 00:04:10.249
and you put in parentheses
"they have good taste."

00:04:10.249 --> 00:04:13.485
He's like a guy who gets caught
on camera robbing a liquor store

00:04:13.485 --> 00:04:14.887
and says, "That's not me,

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:17.323
but whoever it is
is very handsome."

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:18.824
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.824 --> 00:04:21.227
And it's not just the Air Force
and the Vice President

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:22.995
who are helping line
Trump's pockets.

00:04:22.995 --> 00:04:25.765
It was also reported last week
that Attorney General Bill Barr

00:04:25.765 --> 00:04:28.667
had booked Trump's hotel
for a $30,000 holiday party.

00:04:28.667 --> 00:04:31.203
Trump was asked about all
the money flowing from taxpayers

00:04:31.203 --> 00:04:32.872
to his private businesses
last week

00:04:32.872 --> 00:04:35.107
and once again claimed
he had nothing to do with it

00:04:35.107 --> 00:04:36.675
while also taking
the opportunity

00:04:36.675 --> 00:04:38.411
to advertise his resorts.

00:04:38.411 --> 00:04:40.479
-Can you speak to,
um, your involvement

00:04:40.479 --> 00:04:42.147
in the Vice President's plans

00:04:42.147 --> 00:04:43.916
to stay at a Trump property
in Ireland?

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.686
-Well, I had no involvement,
other than it's a great place.

00:04:46.686 --> 00:04:48.921
It's Doonbeg. I own it.
It's in Ireland.

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:51.557
It's beautiful. It's wonderful.
I don't suggest anything.

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:54.627
I don't suggest it, nor did I
with the Attorney General.

00:04:54.627 --> 00:04:57.563
I never spoke to the Attorney
General about using my hotel.

00:04:57.563 --> 00:04:59.699
I have a lot of hotels
all over the place,

00:04:59.699 --> 00:05:01.967
and people use them
because they're the best.

00:05:01.967 --> 00:05:03.736
I mean, you know,
they're the best.

00:05:03.736 --> 00:05:06.405
But, uh, he's using the hotel.

00:05:06.405 --> 00:05:08.841
And, uh...

00:05:08.841 --> 00:05:10.776
People like my product.
What can I tell you?

00:05:10.776 --> 00:05:12.244
Can't help it.

00:05:12.244 --> 00:05:14.614
But, uh, you know,
and I guess they say,

00:05:14.614 --> 00:05:16.082
"We want to stay at a place

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:18.217
that's better
than someplace else."

00:05:18.217 --> 00:05:21.153
-Well, that is really
quite the endorsement.

00:05:21.153 --> 00:05:23.222
Sandals should steal
that slogan.

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:27.059
Sandals -- a place that's better
than someplace else.

00:05:27.059 --> 00:05:29.628
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:29.628 --> 00:05:32.464
Of course, all of this --

00:05:32.464 --> 00:05:35.201
All of this comes after
Trump spent the entire week

00:05:35.201 --> 00:05:37.036
lying about a hurricane
and insisting

00:05:37.036 --> 00:05:39.104
that it was gonna hit Alabama,
going even so far

00:05:39.104 --> 00:05:41.274
as to alter an official forecast
with a Sharpie.

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:45.544
Now, we -- we don't want
to keep talking about this.

00:05:45.544 --> 00:05:47.947
We would have been happy
to just let this go

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:50.115
as another one of the million
dumb things Trump has done.

00:05:50.115 --> 00:05:52.652
We talked about it on Thursday,
had a few days off,

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:54.587
and figured we'd wake up
to a new day

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:56.722
of fresh crimes
and flaming dancers,

00:05:56.722 --> 00:05:59.058
but Trump
keeps talking about it,

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:01.226
and, as we all know, once Trump
gets called out for a lie,

00:06:01.226 --> 00:06:03.229
he will not stop
until he gets the last word.

00:06:03.229 --> 00:06:05.130
Everything else
has to grind to a halt

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.567
while we watch this
sweaty weirdo bark at reporters

00:06:07.567 --> 00:06:10.002
and insist that he's correct
by tweeting nonstop

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:12.604
or doing that thing
where he points at his own brain

00:06:12.604 --> 00:06:15.808
to show us all how smart he is.

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:18.243
"They did a CAT scan of my brain
and said it was huge.

00:06:18.243 --> 00:06:20.713
Here. Let me show you a photo."

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:22.181
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.181 --> 00:06:24.483
I mean, look at him.

00:06:24.483 --> 00:06:28.720
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:31.657
This looks like the start
of a kids' video called

00:06:31.657 --> 00:06:35.661
"Head, Shoulders, Knees,
and I Can't Reach My Toes."

00:06:35.661 --> 00:06:37.530
But Trump initially pretended

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:40.066
he had no idea
who defaced his hurricane map.

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:41.767
Well, it won't surprise you
to learn

00:06:41.767 --> 00:06:43.969
that after the "Washington Post"
did some digging,

00:06:43.969 --> 00:06:46.172
they found out
who the culprit was.

00:06:46.172 --> 00:06:48.173
It was Trump
who used the black Sharpie

00:06:48.173 --> 00:06:49.442
to mark up an official

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:51.410
National Oceanic and Atmospheric
Administration map,

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:53.279
which he displayed
during an Oval Office briefing

00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:55.113
on Wednesday according
to a White House official

00:06:55.113 --> 00:06:56.883
who spoke on the condition
of anonymity.

00:06:56.883 --> 00:07:00.886
No one else writes like that
on a map with a black Sharpie.

00:07:00.886 --> 00:07:02.254
It's amazing to me

00:07:02.254 --> 00:07:04.357
that reporters actually
had to spend time on this.

00:07:04.357 --> 00:07:06.325
They actually had to call up
anonymous sources

00:07:06.325 --> 00:07:08.628
and get them to reveal
who the Sharpie culprit was.

00:07:08.628 --> 00:07:11.430
It's like Watergate, except
Trump is his own Deep Throat.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.298
He's Cheap Throat.

00:07:13.298 --> 00:07:15.501
"Don't worry. We don't need
to pay for a new map.

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:18.704
I'll just draw on it
with a Sharpie. Everyone
will think it's real."

00:07:18.704 --> 00:07:24.076
It's probably what he did
for each of Eric's birthdays.

00:07:24.076 --> 00:07:28.114
Now, Trump has tried to muddy
the waters and confuse everyone

00:07:28.114 --> 00:07:30.015
by making this
as complicated as possible,

00:07:30.015 --> 00:07:31.551
so let's keep it very simple --

00:07:31.551 --> 00:07:33.385
last Sunday, September 1st,

00:07:33.385 --> 00:07:35.488
Trump tweeted that Alabama
will most likely be hit

00:07:35.488 --> 00:07:38.056
much harder than anticipated
and then 20 minutes later,

00:07:38.056 --> 00:07:40.726
the National Weather Service
in Birmingham, Alabama, tweeted,

00:07:40.726 --> 00:07:43.328
"Alabama will not see
any impacts from Dorian,"

00:07:43.328 --> 00:07:44.863
and as we learned this weekend,

00:07:44.863 --> 00:07:47.066
that correction wasn't the
National Weather Service

00:07:47.066 --> 00:07:48.700
going out of their way
to embarrass Trump.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:50.770
They had to issue that
correction specifically

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:52.305
in response to Alabama residents

00:07:52.305 --> 00:07:54.373
who were freaked out
by the President's tweet.

00:07:54.373 --> 00:07:55.574
The Washington Post reported

00:07:55.574 --> 00:07:57.409
that the Birmingham office sent
the tweet

00:07:57.409 --> 00:07:59.111
after receiving
a flurry of phone calls

00:07:59.111 --> 00:08:01.213
from concerned residents
following Trump's message.

00:08:01.213 --> 00:08:02.548
We're now at the point

00:08:02.548 --> 00:08:04.650
where the President
is scaring people for no reason.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:09.321
He is basically
the WebMD of presidents.

00:08:09.321 --> 00:08:11.389
He said no matter --

00:08:11.389 --> 00:08:13.192
No matter what symptom...

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:16.829
[ Applause ]

00:08:16.829 --> 00:08:18.730
No matter what symptom
you type in, the response says,

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:23.636
"Sounds bad.
You're probably gonna die."

00:08:23.636 --> 00:08:24.503
Seriously, think about that.

00:08:24.503 --> 00:08:25.837
People were calling

00:08:25.837 --> 00:08:27.673
because the President said
they might be in danger,

00:08:27.673 --> 00:08:29.842
and instead of reassuring them
after he was corrected,

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:31.077
he doubled down.

00:08:31.077 --> 00:08:32.344
It's like if you stood up
in a crowded theater

00:08:32.344 --> 00:08:33.445
and yelled "fire,"

00:08:33.445 --> 00:08:34.546
and then
a theater employee said,

00:08:34.546 --> 00:08:36.182
"Everyone calm down.
There's no fire."

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:37.549
And instead of apologizing,

00:08:37.549 --> 00:08:39.618
you took out a can of gasoline
and a match and said,

00:08:39.618 --> 00:08:42.521
"Well, there's one now."

00:08:42.521 --> 00:08:45.324
But the craziest and most
dangerous part of all of this

00:08:45.324 --> 00:08:47.292
is that Trump has now involved
other parts of the government

00:08:47.292 --> 00:08:48.727
in his war on reality.

00:08:48.727 --> 00:08:51.263
Just today we learned that
Commerce Secretary Wilbur Ross

00:08:51.263 --> 00:08:53.999
threatened firings at NOAA
after Trump Dorian tweets.

00:08:53.999 --> 00:08:56.636
That comes after NOAA staff were
instructed not to contradict

00:08:56.636 --> 00:08:58.471
the President's Sharpie
hurricane forcast,

00:08:58.471 --> 00:09:00.472
and on top of that,
Trump has entire party

00:09:00.472 --> 00:09:01.707
in lockstep with him.

00:09:01.707 --> 00:09:03.942
Just yesterday,
Republican Senator Roy Blount

00:09:03.942 --> 00:09:05.411
dismissed Trump's
compulsive lying,

00:09:05.411 --> 00:09:07.012
although he seemed to pause

00:09:07.012 --> 00:09:09.114
when asked if Americans
could trust the President.

00:09:09.114 --> 00:09:10.950
-Should the American public
take the President

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.951
at his word when he speaks?

00:09:12.951 --> 00:09:14.954
-Well, the President
communicates differently than

00:09:14.954 --> 00:09:16.855
anybody else has ever before --
-You've said that before.

00:09:16.855 --> 00:09:19.258
-As a candidate, he -- the --
the American public --

00:09:19.258 --> 00:09:20.492
-He's President
of the United States,

00:09:20.492 --> 00:09:23.628
and when he issues a --
politicizing the weather.

00:09:23.628 --> 00:09:25.597
I mean, is there anything left?

00:09:25.597 --> 00:09:26.899
-Well, I-I-I actually --

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:29.801
I've spent most of this month
at home in Missouri,

00:09:29.801 --> 00:09:33.105
uh, and I don't --
I think this --

00:09:33.105 --> 00:09:36.475
this whole Sharpie thing
is way being over-played.

00:09:36.475 --> 00:09:38.043
-Are you worried
that the credibility

00:09:38.043 --> 00:09:40.012
of the words of the
President of the United States

00:09:40.012 --> 00:09:41.113
has been eroded?

00:09:42.748 --> 00:09:43.783
-No.

00:09:43.783 --> 00:09:45.484
[ Laughter ]

00:09:45.484 --> 00:09:47.452
-It should not take you
that long to answer

00:09:47.452 --> 00:09:49.855
when someone asks you if the
President you support is a liar.

00:09:49.855 --> 00:09:51.156
That's like a husband
who just got back

00:09:51.156 --> 00:09:52.190
from a guys trip to Vegas.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:53.592
"Did you have fun, honey?"
"Yeah."

00:09:53.592 --> 00:09:55.061
"Did you get a lap dance?"

00:09:56.295 --> 00:09:57.196
"No."

00:09:57.196 --> 00:10:00.232
[ Laughter ]

00:10:00.232 --> 00:10:03.468
And then there's Fox News,
and entire propaganda network

00:10:03.468 --> 00:10:06.105
that, with few exceptions,
reinforces the President's

00:10:06.105 --> 00:10:08.774
deranged alternate reality
on a daily basis

00:10:08.774 --> 00:10:11.410
then denies obvious facts
that are plain to our eyes.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.712
In fact, just last month
an anchor on Fox Business

00:10:13.712 --> 00:10:15.447
actually insisted
during an interview

00:10:15.447 --> 00:10:17.482
with one of Trump's Republican
primary challengers

00:10:17.482 --> 00:10:19.651
that the President
has never told a lie.

00:10:19.651 --> 00:10:21.620
-I'm running
against this President

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.622
because I believe he lies

00:10:23.622 --> 00:10:26.225
virtually every time
he opens his mouth.

00:10:26.225 --> 00:10:27.793
You know that, too.

00:10:27.793 --> 00:10:29.328
-No, I do not.
-I believe he's morally unfit.

00:10:29.328 --> 00:10:31.230
-I do not know that.
Don't impute --

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.132
Do not impute that
to me, Joe Walsh.

00:10:33.132 --> 00:10:35.468
-And I believe it is a danger
to this country.

00:10:35.468 --> 00:10:38.303
Stuart, do you believe
this President lies?

00:10:38.303 --> 00:10:39.705
-No.

00:10:39.705 --> 00:10:41.273
-You don't believe
he's ever lied?

00:10:41.273 --> 00:10:42.641
-He exaggerates and spins.

00:10:42.641 --> 00:10:46.712
-Yeah, those are other ways
of saying he lies.

00:10:46.712 --> 00:10:49.514
Do Fox News anchors keep a
thesaurus with them at all times

00:10:49.514 --> 00:10:50.816
for moments like this?

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:53.051
"Does the President lie?"
"No, he...

00:10:53.051 --> 00:10:58.090
beguiles, obfuscates,
prevaricates, and dissembles."

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.558
Also, it's very hard
to come off as a moron

00:10:59.558 --> 00:11:02.127
when you're a guy with a British
accent using the word "impute,"

00:11:02.127 --> 00:11:03.662
but, somehow,
this guy managed to do it.

00:11:03.662 --> 00:11:06.365
Although, if Brexit
has taught us anything,

00:11:06.365 --> 00:11:08.500
it's that British people
are just as prone

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.703
to putting dummies
in charge as we are,

00:11:10.703 --> 00:11:12.203
like this dummy.

00:11:12.203 --> 00:11:14.039
-Do you know the caution?

00:11:14.039 --> 00:11:15.440
Do you know what you have to say
when you -- when you --

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:18.978
when you --
when you call on someone?

00:11:18.978 --> 00:11:21.180
You do not have to say anything.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.448
Is that right?

00:11:23.448 --> 00:11:25.651
Anything you --

00:11:25.651 --> 00:11:29.488
No, but if you fail
to mention something...

00:11:29.488 --> 00:11:31.690
which you later...

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.692
rely on --

00:11:33.692 --> 00:11:36.095
Hang on, let's get this right.

00:11:36.095 --> 00:11:37.729
You remember it?

00:11:37.729 --> 00:11:40.199
They all know it.

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:45.504
Which you late-- Which you later
rely on in court...

00:11:45.504 --> 00:11:48.173
may be...

00:11:48.173 --> 00:11:51.242
taken into account...

00:11:51.242 --> 00:11:52.878
Anyway, you get the gist.

00:11:52.878 --> 00:11:55.480
[ Laughter ]

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.383
-I don't know.

00:11:57.383 --> 00:11:59.318
I don't know if we did
get the gist.

00:11:59.318 --> 00:12:01.287
I mean, that's their --

00:12:01.287 --> 00:12:03.322
Their Prime Minister is like

00:12:03.322 --> 00:12:05.757
if Donald Trump had
one of those GPS settings

00:12:05.757 --> 00:12:07.860
where you could just switch him
to a British accent.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.061
[ Laughter ]

00:12:09.061 --> 00:12:10.529
[ British accent ]
"I think the best way, uh,

00:12:10.529 --> 00:12:12.364
for Britain out
of the European Union

00:12:12.364 --> 00:12:16.735
is, uh, through
the Tallahassee Trail."

00:12:16.735 --> 00:12:19.137
[ Normal voice ]
Although my favorite,

00:12:19.137 --> 00:12:22.774
favorite Boris Johnson clip
from this last week, hands down,

00:12:22.774 --> 00:12:24.042
has to be this one.

00:12:24.042 --> 00:12:26.779
-Please leave my town.
-I will very soon.

00:12:26.779 --> 00:12:32.618
[ Laughter ]

00:12:32.618 --> 00:12:35.854
-That might be the most British
thing I've ever seen.

00:12:35.854 --> 00:12:36.955
"Good day, sir.

00:12:36.955 --> 00:12:41.326
Now, please do [bleep] off.
Cheerio."

00:12:41.326 --> 00:12:45.798
Americans, of course,
we are slightly less polite.

00:12:45.798 --> 00:12:48.434
-Mr. President, [bleep] you!

00:12:48.434 --> 00:12:49.468
[ Laughter ]

00:12:49.468 --> 00:12:51.437
The British one --

00:12:51.437 --> 00:12:54.206
The British one was good...

00:12:54.206 --> 00:12:57.509
but I do like
the American remake.

00:12:57.509 --> 00:12:59.211
The President of the
United States isn't just lying.

00:12:59.211 --> 00:13:02.047
He's concocting elaborate
fantasies to defend those lies,

00:13:02.047 --> 00:13:05.117
strong arming the rest of his
government to justify those lies

00:13:05.117 --> 00:13:07.852
and relying on the support
of an entire political party

00:13:07.852 --> 00:13:10.288
and right-wing media apparatus
to spread those lies.

00:13:10.288 --> 00:13:11.790
It might seem trivial

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:14.493
when it's just about
Sharpies or flaming dancers,

00:13:14.493 --> 00:13:16.395
but Trump's war on reality

00:13:16.395 --> 00:13:19.131
also has real consequences
for real people.

00:13:19.131 --> 00:13:21.166
At this point, we'd be much
better off if,

00:13:21.166 --> 00:13:22.400
instead of being President,

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.802
Trump just spent
his time hiking...

00:13:23.802 --> 00:13:25.804
-The Tallahassee Trail.

00:13:25.804 --> 00:13:27.706
-This has been A Closer Look.

00:13:27.706 --> 00:13:31.410
[ Cheers and applause ]

